---
import { race } from './model.mjs';
const initial = race.stale[0];
---
<figure class="relational-figure mug-race" data-mug-race>
 <p class="figure-title">Who gets the last blue mug?</p>
 <label>Stock change <select data-policy><option value="stale">Read, calculate, write</option><option value="guarded">Conditional subtraction</option></select></label>
 <p class="stage" data-title data-live>{initial[0]}</p>
 <div class="race-people"><div><strong>Mina · order 103</strong><p data-mina data-live>{initial[2]}</p></div><div><strong>Tariq · order 104</strong><p data-tariq data-live>{initial[3]}</p></div></div>
 <table><caption>Committed state · product P7</caption><thead><tr><th>stock</th><th>Accepted new orders</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-stock data-live>{initial[4]}</td><td data-orders data-live>{initial[5]}</td></tr></tbody></table>
 <p data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">{initial[1]}</p>
 <div class="step-controls"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 5</span></div>
 <div class="hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
 <figcaption>Figure 3. Illustrative PostgreSQL Read Committed histories, verified on a native server with competing buyers. One blue mug is available before order 103. Both options use transactions; only the conditional option rechecks availability when it changes stock. The display shows committed stock, so Mina’s uncommitted subtraction is described in her lane. Tea and order writes are omitted from the picture; the accompanying protocol includes them. No payment or cancellation occurs during either history. Underlined values changed at this step.</figcaption>
 <details><summary>Read this figure as text</summary><p>With an earlier read followed by a calculated assignment, both customers read 1 and later write 0. Both orders commit: two mugs sold, stock 0. With conditional subtraction, Mina changes the row first. Tariq waits, then rechecks against 0 after Mina commits. He changes zero rows and rolls back. Only order 103 is accepted.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import { stepper } from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 import { race } from './model.mjs';
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-mug-race]').forEach(root => {
  const policy = root.querySelector('select');
  const player = stepper(root, {steps: () => race[policy.value].length, draw: index => {
   const row = race[policy.value][index];
   ['title','explanation','mina','tariq','stock','orders'].forEach((name, i) => { const node = root.querySelector(`[data-${name}]`); const next = String(row[i]); node.classList.toggle('changed', !['title','explanation'].includes(name) && node.textContent !== next); node.textContent = next; });
  }});
  policy.addEventListener('change', () => player.render());
 });
</script>
<style>
 .mug-race .figure-title{margin-top:0;font-weight:700}.mug-race .changed{font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}.mug-race label{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;font-size:.85rem}.mug-race select{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.5rem;max-width:100%}.mug-race .stage{font-weight:700}.race-people{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem}.race-people>div{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);background:var(--color-surface);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.race-people p{font-size:.85rem;margin:.5rem 0 0}.mug-race table{display:table;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}.mug-race caption{text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.mug-race [data-step]{border:0;padding:.4rem;font-size:.8rem}.mug-race [data-explanation]{font-size:.92rem;min-height:4.5em}.hold{height:.2rem;background:var(--color-rule)}.hold span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-text)}.mug-race details{font-size:.85rem}.mug-race button[aria-disabled="true"]{color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:600px){.race-people{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mug-race [data-explanation]{min-height:0}}
</style>
